Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

OrderId={{orderA1}}&OriginalDishId={{gaId}}&RequestedDishId={{caId}}&Quantity=30&Reason=[DEMO] khách dị ứng gà

###
@mc1 = {{mc1.response.body.data.request.id}}

###
