###
GET {{base}}/api/ProductionPlan/GetDetail?id={{planId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/MenuChangeRequest/GetDetail?id={{mc1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

